<title>UK: UK's Nationwide b/soc ups mortgage rate to 7.35pct.</title>
<headline>UK's Nationwide b/soc ups mortgage rate to 7.35pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK's Nationwide building society on Friday said it had raised its key variable mortgage rate by 36 basis points to 7.35 percent with effect from June 1.</p>
<p>The Nationwide is one of the few remaining mutually-owned building societies which are pledged to keeping their home loan rates below those of building societies which have converted to bank status.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
